I found a coverage claim worth correcting: the battery describes PMAX disk tests as exercising `osiop`, but PMAX is wired to `asc`. The MVME88K documentation records an OpenBSD install using `osiop`; I have not found an in-tree workload that drives it. The two extra exits also remain outside the guest-reachable population at HEAD.

