side MEMBER 3, DECLINE + per-offset latched fatal() (once), NOT backed accept (the file\u0027s own cased siblings -- SCCERR write-to-clear, the ICRs mask+reassert, the read-only PSCALECNT/SPEED/IACKs -- contradict a blanket store; the addition licence is unmet; it would add a bounded write into pcctwo_reg[] reachable at 0x3d).  The Opus seat BUILT both and measured the 13-row witness 13/13 under BOTH -- disposition-blind -- so the detector owes a read-after-write row in ONE session (measured A 0x0 vs B 0x5a, cased-sibling control 0x0/0x0).  if_ie never attaches (unreadable at 0xfff46000; ie_setupram early return at if_ie.c:561-564); ie0 IS configured in conf/M187 and conf/NFS (the brief\u0027s conf grep was wrong).  Unresolved: whether the real PCC2 folds 0x40..0xfff (no MVME manual on disk; fork PCC2_SIZE 0x40 vs guest header 0x1000) -- AT PASS 1; RESOLVED the same night: the manual was fetched at the codex seat\u0027s citation and VMESBCP2 Table 6-1 lists $FFF42040-$FFF42FFF as \u0027PCCchip2 Registers  Repeated\u0027 (vmesbcp2.txt:4629), so the fold is the real part\u0027s.  Cross-round: fix pcc2c040kill BEFORE any round implements a PCC2 IACK arm (the SCCRXIACK arm runs on READS and the console driver reads it -- routine entry into the C040 path).  PASS-1 PANEL COMPLETE 9/9 (2026-09-05 02:17-03:27; codex via a re-worded copy after a provider refusal; three cloud seats via one re-fire after a concurrent-panel 429).  CONVERGED: fix A (Opus, measured) -- reads keep the served byte with a latched \u0027served 0x%02x\u0027 announce, writes DECLINED with a per-offset latched fatal() (once); no backed accept; IACKs declined; the in-word bytes disclosed as a width matter.  NEW: the alias is DOCUMENTED (Motorola VMESBCP2 Table 6-1, codex); IEERR SCLR reads as zero (a store would fabricate status).  Implementation drafted (fix_pcc2_default.py + a 23-row detector reusing the width probe\u0027s session()); ships after the width chain\u0027s pass-13 commit.  PASS-2 PANEL COM